menu "live_transcriber"

    config LIVE_TRANSCRIBER_DEBUG_LINK
        bool "Debug link over USB High-Speed"
        default n
        help
            The PC's commands, the log, the final words and screenshots over the board's USB High-Speed port
            (WinUSB on the PC), and the weights from the PC when the SD card has none. The tests in debug/tests
            need it. sdkconfig.debug turns it on; a release build leaves it off.

endmenu
